# Project goal
look into [README.md](mdc:README.md) to get an overview of the overall goal of the project.

## Package manager
The project uses package manager uv

## Coding style 
We use exclusively python. 
We want linted, and strongly typed python.
- We use ruff for linting and formatting
- We use pyright for typechecking

## Package manager

- Add a package:
  uv add <package>

- Remove a package:
  uv remove <package>

- Sync environment (install all dependencies):
  uv sync

- Run a script or command in the project environment:
  uv run <command>

## Linting, fixing, and typechecking

- Lint the codebase:
  uv run ruff check .

- Auto-fix lint issues:
  uv run ruff check . --fix

- Format the codebase:
  uv run ruff format .

- Typecheck the codebase:
  uv run pyright



